<title>USA: Area names John Ray Executive VP/CFO.</title>
<headline>Area names John Ray Executive VP/CFO.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Area Bancshares Corp said Monday that it promoted John Ray to the office of Executive Vice President and Chief Financial Officer.</p>
<p>The company issued a news release saying Ray had served as Senior Vice President and CFO since 1994.</p>
